        "original_id": "1a0aba7d-6863-5251-9fc0-151f70c436ca",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Svend Borberg, N. C. Borberg, William Borberg, Claus von Bülow, Sunny von Bülow\n- Events: 1979 attempted murder accusation, trials\n\nFacts:\n- Svend Borberg was the brother of N. C. Borberg and William Borberg.\n- Svend Borberg was the father of Claus von Bülow.\n- In 1979, Claus von Bülow was accused of the attempted murder of his wife Sunny von Bülow.\n- Sunny von Bülow was born Martha Sharp Crawford and lived from 1932 to 2008.\n- The 1979 incident left Sunny von Bülow in a coma, and she later recovered.\n- Claus von Bülow was convicted in his first trial, but that conviction was reversed.\n- Claus von Bülow was found not guilty at his second trial.",
